WHOTOPIA PROJECT DOCUMENTATION


1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Whotopia is a web-based multiplayer implementation of the classic Nigerian card game "Whot" (similar to Crazy Eights / UNO). Built with React 18, Firebase, and Vite.

It supports single-player mode against AI opponents (Easy, Medium, Hard), multiplayer mode via Realtime Database synced rooms with up to 6 players, in-game chat with reply, delete, selection, and notification sounds, user profiles, match history, leaderboards, reviews, and admin management, and dark mode with full light/dark theming via CSS custom properties.

Live deployment is on Vercel using SPA with rewrites to index.html.


