5. GAME ENGINE (src/game/)

5.1 Rules (rules.js)

Default game rules:
  startingCards: 5
  stackingPenalties: true
  allowMultiPlay: false
  enablePick2: true
  enablePick3: true
  enableSuspension: true
  enableHoldOn: true
  enableGeneralMarket: true
  allowDefendPick2: true
  allowDefendPick3: true
  whotCardPower: 'full' (options: 'full', 'limited', 'off')


5.2 Deck (WhotDeck.js)

54 cards total across 5 symbols:
  Circle (12 cards): values 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14
  Triangle (12 cards): values 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14
  Cross (9 cards): values 1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 10, 11, 13, 14
  Square (9 cards): values 1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 10, 11, 13, 14
  Star (7 cards): values 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8
  Whot (5 cards): value 20, wild card

Special card values:
  1 = Hold On
  2 = Pick Two
  5 = Pick Three
  8 = Suspension
  14 = General Market
  20 = Whot (wild card)


5.3 Game Engine (GameEngine.js, 429 lines)

Core methods:
  initGame(playerNames, cardsPerPlayer) - Creates players, builds/shuffles deck, deals cards, flips first card
  canPlayCard(card, playerId) - Validates if a card can be played
  playCard(card, playerId, chosenSymbol) - Plays a card, applies special effects, checks for win, advances turn
  drawCard(playerId) - Draws from deck (handles penalty draws separately)
  applySpecialEffects(card, playerId) - Applies Hold On, Pick 2, Pick 3, Suspension, General Market
  advanceTurn() - Moves to next active player, handles skip/penalty states
  getGameState(playerId) - Returns player-specific game state with valid moves
  getValidCards(playerId) - Filters hand to playable cards
  exportState() / importState(state) - Serialize/deserialize for Firebase sync

Penalty defense system:
When facing a Pick 2 penalty, you can defend by playing another Pick 2 (value=2), which passes the penalty. Same for Pick 3 (value=5).


5.4 AI Engine (AIEngine.js, 116 lines)

Three difficulty levels:

Easy: Plays the first valid card randomly.

Medium: Prioritizes non-special cards when hand > 4, pick cards when hand > 6, hold cards, whot cards when hand <= 3, suspension, general market when hand > 3.

Hard: Scores each move with weighted factors: whot (+50/+30), hold (+25), pick2 (+20), pick3 (+25), suspension (+15), general market (+10/+20), winning move (+100), near-win (+15).

Symbol selection (for Whot cards): Chooses the symbol with the most cards in hand.


6. FIREBASE ARCHITECTURE

6.1 Services Used

Firebase Authentication: Email/password, Google OAuth, Anonymous sign-in
Cloud Firestore: User profiles, match history, leaderboards, reviews, notifications
Realtime Database: Game rooms, room players, active game state, chat messages


6.2 Firestore Collections

users (Document ID: Auth UID)
  Key fields: displayName, email, photoURL, stats (wins, losses, winRate, winStreak, bestWinStreak), settings, isRemoved, wasReadded

matchHistory (Document ID: Auto-generated)
  Key fields: players[], winner, gameMode, duration, timestamp

reviews (Document ID: Auto-generated)
  Key fields: userId, displayName, email, review, suggestion, timestamp

postedReviews (Document ID: Auto-generated)
  Key fields: displayName, email, review, suggestion, timestamp

notifications (Document ID: Auto-generated)
  Key fields: recipientId, senderId, senderName, roomCode, roomName, message, read, expired, createdAt


6.3 Realtime Database Paths

gameRooms/{roomId}
  Room metadata: roomId, name, hostId, maxPlayers, currentPlayers, status, gameMode, rules

gameRooms/{roomId}/players/{playerId}
  Player info: displayName, photoURL, status, isHost, joinedAt

activeGames/{roomId}
  Full game state (exported from GameEngine): players, deck, currentTurn, drawPenalty, etc.

chat/{roomId}/{messageId}
  Chat messages: text, senderId, senderName, timestamp, replyTo, deleted, deletedBy


6.4 Firebase Hooks

useAuth - Returns: user, loading, error, isAuthenticated, isGuest, signUp, signIn, googleSignIn, guestSignIn, logout, updateProfile, resetPassword, deleteAccount

useUserProfile(userId) - Returns: profile, loading, updateProfile, createProfile

useMatchHistory(userId) - Returns: matches, loading, fetchMatchHistory, recordMatch, clearHistory

useLeaderboard(type) - Returns: leaderboard, loading

useNotifications(userId) - Returns: notifications, loading, unreadCount, markRead, markExpired

useGameRoom(roomId) - Returns: room, loading, createRoom, updateRoom, deleteRoom

useAvailableRooms() - Returns: rooms, loading, fetchRooms

useRoomPlayers(roomId) - Returns: players, loading, addPlayer, removePlayer

useGameState(roomId) - Returns: gameState, loading, setGame, updateGame, endGame

useChat(roomId) - Returns: messages, loading, sendMessage, clearMessages


