8. COMPONENTS

8.1 Sidebar (src/components/Sidebar.jsx)
Collapsible desktop sidebar with navigation items. Mobile hamburger menu with overlay. Navigation items: Home, Dashboard, Players, Play (submenu: vs Computer, vs Players), How to Play, Settings, Review, Terms. Review link hidden if user has already reviewed (tracked in localStorage). Admin users see "Reviews" link instead of "Review". Theme toggle, notifications badge, sign out button. Play submenu expands/collapses.

8.2 AdminSidebar (src/components/AdminSidebar.jsx)
Separate sidebar for admin pages (/admin-reviews, /admin-players). Links: Review, Players Management. Theme toggle, sign out.

8.3 ChatAside (src/components/ChatAside.jsx, 541 lines)
Full-featured in-game chat with real-time message sync via Firebase Realtime Database (onChildAdded, onChildChanged). Reply: Swipe right on a message to reply. Selection mode: Long-press (500ms) to enter selection mode. Delete: Delete for me (localStorage) or delete for everyone (Firebase update). Copy: Copy selected message text. Notification sound: Web Audio API sine wave beep when message arrives and chat is closed. Mute toggle: Persisted to localStorage. Message status indicators (sending, sent, failed). Auto-scroll to bottom on new messages.

8.4 LoadingSpinner (src/components/LoadingSpinner.jsx)
Animated SVG "W" letter formed by 4 staggered line segments.

8.5 Auth Components (src/components/auth/)
  LoginForm: Email/password fields, show/hide password toggle, Google sign-in button, forgot password link, sign up link
  RegisterForm: Display name (max 10 chars, no spaces), email, password, confirm password, terms checkbox, Google sign-up
  ForgotPasswordForm: Email input, sends reset link, success/error states
  ProtectedRoute: Shows spinner while loading, redirects to /login if no user
  PublicRoute: Shows spinner while loading, redirects to /dashboard if user exists

8.6 Game Components (src/components/game/)
  Card: Renders a single Whot card with symbol, value, color, special effect labels
  PlayerHand: Renders the player's hand as a horizontal row of Card components
  OpponentArea: Shows opponent cards (card count), active turn indicator
  CardAnimationLayer: Flying card animations using CSS custom properties for start/end positions


9. PAGES

9.1 LandingPage (src/pages/LandingPage.jsx)
Public marketing page with hero section (animated card stack, stats: 10K+ players, 50K+ games, 4.9 rating), features grid (Multiplayer, Leaderboards, Easy to Learn, Match History, In-Game Chat, Secure & Fair), How to Play section (4 steps), Testimonials (3 Nigerian user reviews), CTA section and footer.

9.2 LoginPage (src/pages/LoginPage.jsx)
Split-screen auth page with brand side (Whotopia logo, features) and form side. Switches between login, register, and forgot password forms.

9.3 HomePage (src/pages/HomePage.jsx)
Dashboard for logged-in users with personalized greeting (Good morning/afternoon/evening), avatar (Google photo or DiceBear anime avatar or initial), stats cards (Games Played, Total Wins), Quick Play buttons (vs Computer, Play Online), quick links (How to Play, Game Settings), clear match history button with confirmation modal.

9.4 GamePage (src/pages/GamePage.jsx, 1128 lines)
The main game interface handling both AI and online modes.

AI Mode: Difficulty selection screen (Easy, Medium, Hard), card dealing animation (shuffle, deal, reveal), player hand, opponent area, draw pile, play area, AI turns with 1-second thinking delay, card animations (flying cards for play/draw), wrong move feedback ("Wrong move emoji"), one-card warning when opponent has 1 card, game over screens (celebration bubbles, victory cup animation, or loss screen).

Online Mode: Connects to Firebase Realtime Database for game state sync. Host initializes game state; both players listen for updates. Chat panel (ChatAside). Offline detection and reconnection overlay. Opponent left detection and cancellation. onDisconnect handler removes player from room on disconnect.

Game Over: Records match to Firestore (only AI games count toward stats).

9.5 LobbyPage (src/pages/LobbyPage.jsx, 741 lines)
Multiplayer room management. Create Room: Generates 4-character alphanumeric code (excludes ambiguous chars I, O, 0, 1), creates Firebase room, adds self as host. Join Room: Enter 4-character code, validates room exists and is waiting. Room View: Shows room code (copyable), player list with avatars, host badge. Rules Configuration: Host can toggle game rules (starting cards, stack penalties, multi-play, Whot card power, all card effects). Start Game: Host starts when 2+ players joined, marks notifications as expired. Share Code: Navigates to ShareCodePage for in-app invites. Auto-join: Supports ?join=CODE query parameter for deep linking from notifications.

9.6 HowToPlayPage (src/pages/HowToPlayPage.jsx)
Interactive rules guide with parallax hero with floating card animations, floating navigation dots (Overview, Card Deck, Basic Rules, Special Cards, Tips), scroll progress bar, flip cards for special card descriptions, 5 strategy tips.

9.7 SettingsPage (src/pages/SettingsPage.jsx)
Tabbed settings interface. Profile: Display name, bot name, avatar selection (10 DiceBear anime avatars). Game Rules: Starting cards, defend penalties, multi-play, Whot card power. Card Effects: Toggle Pick 2, Pick 3, Suspension, Hold On, General Market. Defense Rules: Toggle defend Pick 2, defend Pick 3. Display and Audio: AI difficulty, sound effects, animations, card hints, auto-play. Settings saved to localStorage('whotopia_settings'). Profile changes synced to Firebase.

9.8 PlayersPage (src/pages/PlayersPage.jsx)
Public list of all registered users with search. Shows wins, losses, win rate. Hides removed players.

9.9 ShareCodePage (src/pages/ShareCodePage.jsx)
Invite system. Displays room code (auto-copied to clipboard). List of eligible players with search, select all. Sends in-app notification to selected players via Firestore batch write.

9.10 NotificationsPage (src/pages/NotificationsPage.jsx)
Lists received room invites. Shows sender, room code, message, timestamp. Checks room status in Realtime Database (active/expired). Join button navigates to lobby with ?join=CODE. Auto-marks as read on view.

9.11 ReviewPage (src/pages/ReviewPage.jsx)
One-time review submission. Checks localStorage and Firestore for existing review. Form: review text + optional suggestion. After submission, redirects to dashboard after 3 seconds. Hides Review link in sidebar after submission.

9.12 TermsPage (src/pages/TermsPage.jsx)
Terms and Conditions with 10 sections, animated intersection observer reveals, side navigation.

9.13 AdminReviewsPage (src/pages/AdminReviewsPage.jsx)
Admin-only page with real-time review list via Firestore onSnapshot. Stats (total reviews, with suggestions). Delete individual reviews or clear all. Refresh button.

9.14 AdminPlayersPage (src/pages/AdminPlayersPage.jsx)
Admin-only page. List all players (active/removed tabs). Search functionality. Remove player (soft delete - sets isRemoved: true). Restore removed player (sets isRemoved: false, wasReadded: true). Shows removed date and who removed them.


10. STYLING

10.1 CSS Architecture
Global: index.css defines CSS custom properties for light/dark themes (HSL colors, shadows, radii, spacing). Component-scoped: Each component/page has its own .css file imported directly. Font: Playfair Display (serif) for body and headings. Color System: 60-30-10 rule via HSL variables. 60% = Background neutrals (bg-primary, bg-secondary). 30% = Supporting tones (borders, hover states). 10% = Accent colors (accent-red, accent-coral, gradient).

10.2 Dark Mode
Toggle via data-theme="dark" attribute on html. All colors swap via CSS variable overrides in :root and [data-theme="dark"].

10.3 Responsive Design
Mobile sidebar collapses to hamburger menu. Game page adapts to mobile viewport. Landing page, HowToPlay, Terms all have responsive layouts. Feature phone screens (320px or less): disables backdrop-filter.


