Special Effects by Value:

Value 1  = Hold On         Same player plays again
Value 2  = Pick Two        Next player draws 2 cards
Value 5  = Pick Three      Next player draws 3 cards
Value 8  = Suspension      Next player's turn is skipped
Value 14 = General Market  Next player draws 1 card
Value 20 = Whot            Wild card, can match any card, player chooses new symbol